# LICENCE BOUNDARY, not an optimisation. A Space is PUBLIC, and data/ holds
# SID_Set, So-Fake-OOD and a CC BY-NC face corpus whose licences do not permit
# redistribution.
#
# This is an ALLOWLIST, and it is an allowlist because the blocklist version of
# it FAILED: it excluded `data/cache/` and missed `data/.cache/` -- dotted, a
# different path -- which shipped HuggingFace download metadata listing the
# private cache repo's contents into the image. A blocklist has to anticipate
# every path; an allowlist only has to name the ones we want.
#
# The demo loads seven .npz (272 KB) and yunet.onnx. Nothing else under data/.
# If a build fails on a missing file, fix the code path -- do not add an
# exception here without checking what its licence permits.
data/**
!data/models/**
data/models/backup_*/**

.git/
.github/
.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
scratchpad/
notebooks/

# Repo furniture the runtime image does not need. docs/figures alone is ~2 MB.
docs/
test-images/variants/
preds.json
*.json.tmp
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
